usage: modelmux [-h] [--version] [-v] [--no-color] <command> ...

Run AI coding CLIs as a secure, OpenAI-compatible API.

positional arguments:
  <command>
    up           start ModelMux (logged-in providers)
    down         stop ModelMux (logins are kept)
    logs         show server logs
    status       what is running, logged in and healthy
    login        log a provider in (guided)
    logout       remove a provider's saved login
    config       print ready-to-paste client config
    doctor       diagnose common problems
    upgrade      run the image matching this CLI version
    key          the API key clients use to call ModelMux

options:
  -h, --help     show this help message and exit
  --version      show program's version number and exit
  -v, --verbose  show details and commands
  --no-color     disable coloured output

Start with: modelmux up, then modelmux login <provider>.
